Implemented `map` generically in `src/lib.rs`:

```rust
pub fn map<T, U, F>(input: Vec<T>, mut function: F) -> Vec<U>
where
    F: FnMut(T) -> U,
{
    let mut result = Vec::with_capacity(input.len());
    for item in input {
        result.push(function(item));
    }
    result
}
```

A manual loop (no `Iterator::map`) builds the output vector. `cargo test --all-targets -- --include-ignored` passes all 12 tests.

